stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  [*] --> proposed
  [*] --> pending
  proposed --> pending: approve
  proposed --> skipped: reject
  pending --> running: start
  running --> review: pull request open
  running --> done: nothing to publish
  review --> done: merged
  review --> running: fix round
  running --> waiting: asked
  waiting --> running: answered
  running --> interrupted: driver fault
  interrupted --> pending: retry due
  interrupted --> attention: driver budget spent
  running --> attention: rounds spent or gave up
  review --> attention: closed without a merge
  attention --> pending: retry
  attention --> done: mark done
  pending --> paused: pause
  paused --> pending: resume
  pending --> skipped: skip
  pending --> cancelled: cancel
